l-sf-y\">\n                <h2 class=\"wb-element wb-widget wb-widget-heading wb-heading\" id=\"wb-el-sf-z\">\n                  How long does delivery take?\n                </h2>\n                <div class=\"wb-element wb-widget wb-widget-paragraph wb-paragraph\" id=\"wb-el-sf-10\">\n                  Standard delivery is 3-5 business days, express is 1-2. Store pickup is ready in about 4 hours.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"wb-element wb-widget wb-widget-div wb-div\" id=\"wb-el-sf-11\">\n                <h2 class=\"wb-element wb-widget wb-widget-heading wb-heading\" id=\"wb-el-sf-12\">\n                  Can I pay the courier in cash?\n                </h2>\n                <div class=\"wb-element wb-widget wb-widget-paragraph wb-paragraph\" id=\"wb-el-sf-13\">\n                  Yes — cash on delivery is available on every order. You choose it at checkout and tell the courier how much to collect.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"wb-element wb-widget wb-widget-div wb-div\" id=\"wb-el-sf-14\">\n                <h2 class=\"wb-element wb-widget wb-widget-heading wb-heading\" id=\"wb-el-sf-15\">\n                  What if I am not home?\n                </h2>\n                <div class=\"wb-element wb-widget wb-widget-paragraph wb-paragraph\" id=\"wb-el-sf-16\">\n                  The courier will try twice. You can allow rescheduling at checkout, or leave a note with a safe place.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"wb-element wb-widget wb-widget-div wb-div\" id=\"wb-el-sf-17\">\n                <h2 class=\"wb-element wb-widget wb-widget-heading wb-heading\" id=\"wb-el-sf-18\">\n                  Do you ship internationally?\n                </h2>\n                <div class=\"wb-element wb-widget wb-widget-paragraph wb-paragraph\" id=\"wb-el-sf-19\">\n                  We ship to 20 countries. Duties are calculated at checkout before you confirm the orde